3. Food Additives
The product may contain food additives permitted in the Food Safety and Standards (Food Products
Standards and Food Additives) Regulations, 2011 in Appendix A under appropriate Food Category(s) and
those listed in GMP Table as applicable. The product may also contain ‗Other substances for use in food
products‘ permitted under regulation 3.3 as per appropriate Food category of the same regulation.‖.
